			"width": 320,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "feat_41_note",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Object States:**\n\n`Draft` ➔ `Testing` ➔ `Stage Ready` ➔ `Retired`\n\nBits transition based on empirical stage laugh data.",
			"x": -720,
			"y": 950,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "feat_42",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Comedy_OS_Note_Taker_Vault/42_Drag_And_Drop_Modular_Setlist_Timeline.md",
			"x": -360,
			"y": 750,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "feat_42_note",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**The Setlist Builder (Granular Control):**\n\nFor comics who need strict control, bits can be viewed as modular cards and dragged into a linear setlist timeline.",
			"x": -360,
			"y": 950,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "feat_43",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Comedy_OS_Note_Taker_Vault/43_Conversational_Semantic_Search_And_Vector_Embeddings.md",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 750,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "feat_43_note",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Chat & Semantic Retrieval:**\n\nYou don’t search folders.\nType or ask: *\"Did the airline baggage joke hit harder in Austin or Denver?\"* or *\"Show me all premises from last month with an A-level laugh\"*.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 950,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "6"
		}
